# Tooltip

Hover/focus hint with delay and skip-delay across items.

<div class="demo-card">
	<Tooltip.Root>
		<Tooltip.Trigger>Hover or focus me</Tooltip.Trigger>
		<Tooltip.Content>Helpful hint with a 600ms hover delay.</Tooltip.Content>
	</Tooltip.Root>
	<Tooltip.Root>
		<Tooltip.Trigger delay={0}>Instant tooltip</Tooltip.Trigger>
		<Tooltip.Content>No delay on this one.</Tooltip.Content>
	</Tooltip.Root>
	<p class="demo-note">After closing one tooltip, the next opens instantly (400ms skip window).</p>
