## API reference

### Tooltip.Root

<ApiTable props={rootProps} />

## Keyboard interactions

- Focus opens immediately; <kbd>blur</kbd> and <kbd>Esc</kbd> close.
- Tooltips never take focus themselves — `role="tooltip"` content is announced via `aria-describedby`.
